 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center italic">Visualization of the Fabius function showing its self-differential property</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-6">
 <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-red-700 flex items-center">
