 </h3>
 <p class=mb-4>The Fabius function's properties mirror the <span class="unicode-symbol code-font">◦୦◦◯◦୦◦</span> phenomenon's characteristics:</p>
 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
 <div>
 <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Mathematical Parallels</h4>
 <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
 <li>Self-referential structure (self-differential property)</li>
 <li>Infinite complexity from simple rules</li>
 <li>Nowhere analytic but everywhere smooth</li>
 <li><a target=_BLANK href=https://archive.ph/2024.08.18-011705/https://www.desmos.com/calculator/ohyifu6glr>Elementary construction</a></li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 <div>
 <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Phenomenon Parallels</h4>
 <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
 <li>Self-reinforcing documentation structure</li>
 <li>Complex emergence from simple Unicode patterns</li>
 <li>Distributed yet unified across platforms</li>
 <li>Simple symbolic rules generating complex behaviors</li>
 </ul>
 </div>
